          "date": "2026-10-21 21:06:45.000000000",
          "tz": -300
        },
        "subject": "LU-19836 tests: fix recovery-small 17b and 26b interop",
        "message": "LU-19836 tests: fix recovery-small 17b and 26b interop\n\nWith master servers, recovery-small 17b and 26b fail when run\nfrom this branch's scripts, as in the interop CI sessions.\n\n17b searches all of /sys for ldlm_enqueue_min, which on newer\nservers also matches the ldlm and per-target tunables. The\nsaved value is then written to read-only files and the test\nfails with 126. Search /sys/module only, as master does.\n\n26b only waits for a multiple of TIMEOUT for the eviction,\nwhich is too short for the later eviction of newer servers.\nUse master's wait, which allows for ldlm_enqueue_min, set\nat_max before the export gets its deadline, and wait for\nthe imports to be connected before counting exports.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=recovery-small env=ONLY=17b\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=recovery-small env=ONLY=26b\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I48d4b442e88cd075ab71b62bdab6100093df4353\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/b2_15"
    }
